    <div class="content rich-text">
      <ul><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-101" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="15f7409d-0c16-4cac-bc26-e500cdeb6b56" data-entity-substitution="canonical">National Instrument 41-101 –&nbsp;<em>General Prospectus Requirements</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-201" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="649320b9-19bb-479c-88ea-74dfce39f4f2" data-entity-substitution="canonical">National Policy 41-201 – <em>Income Trusts and Other Indirect Offerings</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-305" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="3c586355-7b6d-4041-8006-5ba02dc1f7fa" data-entity-substitution="canonical">CSA Staff Notice 41-305 – <em>Share Structure Issues – Initial Public Offerings</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-307" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c8512ce1-94a8-4aea-a9e6-5ab550d7b6c4" data-entity-substitution="canonical">CSA Staff Notice 41-307 – <em>Corporate Finance Prospectus Guidance – Concerns regarding an issuer’s financial condition and the sufficiency of proceeds from a prospectus offering</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-601" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f59f313b-5cbd-4b50-9d06-37cae8b1a3d6" data-entity-substitution="canonical">OSC Policy 41-601 – <em>Capital Pool Companies</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-701" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9e9968d7-a308-4898-9800-86714a70aaea" data-entity-substitution="canonical">OSC Staff Notice 41-701 – <em>Issuance of Receipts for Preliminary Prospectuses and Prospectuses</em></a></li><li><a href="/en/securities-law/instruments-rules-policies/4/41-702" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="be9ee790-509e-4613-afe3-428507a0a5a5" data-entity-substitution="canonical">OSC Staff Notice 41-702 – <em>Prospectus Practice Directive #1 –